#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>I'm almost certain now that the Facility's stolen our genetic information.\n"
"\n"
"Forty-odd employees would make for mighty convenient lab rats, and even if we discovered what Gravitas did, we wouldn't have a lot of legal options. We can't exactly go to the public given the nature of our work.\n"
"\n"
"I can't stop thinking about what sort of experiments they might be conducting on my DNA, but I have to keep my mouth shut.\n"
"\n"
"I can't risk losing my job.</indent>"
msgstr ""

