"\n"
"Engineering has requested the brainmaps of all blueprint subjects for the development of a podlinked software and I am reluctant to oblige.\n"
"\n"
"I believe they are seeking a way to exert temporary control over implanted subjects, and I fear this avenue of research may be ethically unsound.</indent>"
