#. STRINGS.CODEX.B7_TIMESARROWTHOUGHTS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B7_TIMESARROWTHOUGHTS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"I've been unable to shake the notion of the Bow.\n"
"\n"
"The thought of its mechanics are too intriguing, and I can only dream of the mark such a device would make upon the world -- imagine, a source of inexhaustible energy!\n"
"\n"
"So many of humanity's problems could be solved with this one invention - domestic energy, environmental pollution, <i>the fuel wars</i>.\n"
"\n"
"I have to pursue this dream, no matter what."
msgstr ""

