"The Balm Lily naturally contains high vitamin concentrations and produces acids similar in molecular makeup to acetylsalicylic acid (commonly known as aspirin).\n"
"\n"
"As a result, the plant is ideal both for boosting immune systems and treating a variety of common maladies such as pain and fever."
msgstr ""

