#. STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Dasha Saltvine is a unique plant that needs large amounts of salt to balance the levels of water in its body.\n"
"\n"
"In order to keep a supply of salt on hand, the end of the vine is coated in microscopic formations which bind with sodium atoms, forming large crystals over time."
msgstr ""

