#. STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Data Banks are a form of portable storage media. They are prized for their non-volatility, robustness, and practical research applications.\n"
"\n"
"They are not foldable."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.SUBTITLE"
