msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWPALM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWPALM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Gum Palms have developed an eye-catching defense mechanism similar to that of poisonous amphibians.\n"
"\n"
"Bright reddish coloring displayed in their leaves and sharp ornamental bark scales deter most predators, who recognize the warning signs of toxicity. <link=\"PACU\">Pacus</link>, however, consider the tree's highly toxic seed a spicy treat."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWPALM.SUBTITLE
