#. STRINGS.CODEX.DUPLICANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DUPLICANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Duplicants are printed at the <link=\"HEADQUARTERS\">Printing Pod</link>, "
"emerging fully formed and clothed in standard-issue uniforms. Unique outfits"
" can be found in the Supply Closet.\n"
