#. STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Flydo is an airborne delivery robot designed to transport solid items across great distances, both horizontal and vertical.\n"
"\n"
"These wireless robots may deplete their <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link> in mid-flight and temporarily shut down until a replacement is delivered. Once rebooted, they reawaken feeling as energized as if it was their very first day on the job.\n"
"\n"
"Tragically, some powered-down Flydos fall into liquid pools and may never be rebooted at all."
