"Require one (1) Robotics Engineer to travel solo to [REDACTED]. Engineer will print, program and maintain a P.E.G.G.Y. crew of eight (8) units.\n"
"\n"
"Engineer will catalog all Project [REDACTED] debris.\n"
"\n"
"All proprietary equipment to be returned to Facility grounds for investigation. Organic and biohazardous debris may be disposed of onsite at Engineer's discretion.\n"
"\n"
"Candidate: Dr. E. Gossmann\n"
"\n"
"Scope of cleanup area: [REDACTED] sq mi.\n"
"*This is an estimate only.\n"
"\n"
"Timeline: 54 Ceres days (equival. 6 days at origin).\n"
"\n"
"Other comments:\n"
"1. Liability waiver, power of attorney and NDA attached.\n"
"2. Allow up to 0.5 hours for signal transmission from [REDACTED], depending on orbital positioning.\n"
"3. All relevant correspondence to be sent directly to bboson@gipm.nova.\n"
"\n"
"Signature: [REDACTED]\n"
"\n"
