msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The leaf of a <link=\"KELPPLANT\">Seakomb</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be processed into <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link> or used as an ingredient in <link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE \">Allergy Medication</link>."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Plant Byproduct"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.TITLE"
msgid "Seakomb Leaf"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Seakombs are hyperefficient photosynthesizers. While most plants grow towards the light, this aquatic fern's needs are so low that it can prioritize other survival needs.\n"
"\n"
"It sprouts on the ceiling of liquid-filled caves, its tendrils reaching down to brush passing critters. This contact encourages critters to consume the plant and excrete the fertilizer that supports its continued growth."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Plant"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.TITLE
