msgid ""
"Thick logs of <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link> harvested from trees, <link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshells</link>, and other natural sources.\n"
"\n"
"Wood is also used in the production of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> and <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>. They are also a useful building material."
