#. STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Mirth Leaf is a broad-leafed house plant used for decorating living spaces.\n"
"\n"
"The joyous bobbing of the wide green leaves provides hours of amusement for those desperate for entertainment.\n"
"\n"
"Although the Mirth Leaf can inspire laughter and joy, it is not cut out for a career in stand-up comedy."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.SUBTITLE"
