#. STRINGS.CODEX.MUCKROOT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MUCKROOT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Muckroot is an aggressively invasive yet exceedingly delicate root plant known for its earthy flavor and unusual texture.\n"
"\n"
"It is easy to store and keeps for unusually long periods of time, characteristics that once made it a staple food for explorers on long expeditions."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MUCKROOT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MUCKROOT.SUBTITLE"
