msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SEATURTLE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Orehulls are oversized anamniotes prized for the iron ore deposits that adorn their carapace.\n"
"\n"
"Specialized glands between the carapace scutes continuously release microscopic amounts of the heavy metals present in the critter's environment, an immune system reaction that causes no discomfort to the Orehull.\n"
"\n"
