#. STRINGS.CODEX.SPINDLYGRUBFRUITPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SPINDLYGRUBFRUITPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Spindly Grubfruit Plants have leggy stems that limit the distribution of nutrients and enzymes to the fruit-bearing branch. This results in a reliable but relatively tasteless harvest.\n"
"\n"
"Introducing the <link=\"DIVERGENTSPECIES\">Divergent</link> critter species to these plants enable them to develop into <link=\"SUPERWORMPLANT\">Grubfruit Plants</link> with stronger vascular systems and improved fruit."
msgstr ""

