#. STRINGS.CODEX.SPORECHID.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SPORECHID.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Sporechids take advantage of their flower's attractiveness to lure unsuspecting victims into clouds of parasitic Zombie Spores.\n"
"\n"
"They are a rare form of holoparasitic plant which finds mammalian hosts to infect rather than the usual plant species.\n"
"\n"
"The Zombie Spore was originally designed for medicinal purposes but its sedative properties were never refined to the point of usefulness."
msgstr ""

