#. STRINGS.CODEX.SQUID.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SQUID.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Glo Squids are immediately recognizable by the bioluminescent photophores that strobe vertically along their soft bodies.\n"
"\n"
"These tropical critters are distant relatives of the <i>Euprymna scolopes</i>, though rather than navigating via jet propulsion, Glo Squids have evolved a pair of elongated tentacles that enable them to swim upright.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

