"<indent=5%>Another set of masticated windshield wipers has been discovered in Parking Lot D following the Bioengineering Department's critter enclosure breach last week.\n"
"\n"
"Employees are strongly encouraged to plug their vehicles in at lots A-C until further notice.\n"
"\n"
"Please refrain from calling municipal animal control - all critter sightings should be reported directly to Dr. Byron.</indent>"
msgstr ""

