"<size=18>Giga Co-Op</size>\n"
"<i><smallcaps>Proactive solutions for timeless tech</i>\n"
"Open 24/7\n"
"\n"
"Receipt #978-0-465-02656-2\n"
"</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"Dear Patron,\n"
"\n"
"<indent=5%>Thank you for using Giga Co-Op.\n"
"\n"
"Please enter your thirteen-digit receipt number into your machine's control panel to access the updated operator's manual.\n"
"\n"
"Do not print or share this code.\n"
"\n"
"Submit a review and get 4% off your next service!</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps># ITEMS SOLD 2</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"
