#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants have uncovered a fascinating machine. Its construction suggests that it was designed as an energy field disruptor, and retrofitted with printing capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"It is locked behind a 13-digit passcode. One failed attempt could permanently disable the entire building.\n"
"\n"
"I can only hope that the code is also buried somewhere on this world."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME
