msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Success! This building has printed its first viable organism. It contains zero detectable genetic defects.\n"
"\n"
"We can now confidently reroute the Printing Pod's power to print the critters and seeds best suited for my colony's purposes. No species need ever be extinct again.\n"
"\n"
"A small personal item shook loose from the frame during use. Perhaps it belonged to the previous operator."
msgstr ""

