msgid ""
"\"--fascinating that memories are not already inherent in our subjects; however, none as of yet have shown signs of recognition when introduced to familiar stimuli.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Refer to Experiment 7D.\"\n"
"\"Refer to Experiment 7F.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Memories <i>must</i> be embedded within the physical brainmaps of our subjects. The only question that remains is--\""
