#. STRINGS.LORE.BUILDINGS.PropLocker.ENTRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.LORE.BUILDINGS.PropLocker.ENTRY"
msgid ""
"To all employees;\n"
"\n"
"The facility is pleased to announced that starting this week, all Fridays will now be Casual Fridays!\n"
"\n"
"Please enjoy the clinically proven destressing benefits of casual attire by wearing your favorite shirt to the lab.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Any personnel found on facility premises without regulation fullbody protection will be put on immediate notice.\n"
"\n"
"Thank-you and have fun!\n"
"-Admin"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.LORE.BUILDINGS.PropLocker.HEADER
