#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.TASKPRIORITIESMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.TASKPRIORITIESMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"Duplicants always perform errands in order of highest to lowest priority. They will harvest <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> before they build, for example, or always build new structures before they mine materials.\n"
"\n"
"I can open the <b>Priorities Screen</b> {Hotkey/ManagePriorities} to set which Errand Types Duplicants may or may not perform, or to specialize skilled Duplicants for particular Errand Types."
msgstr ""

