msgid ""
"Raw minerals are the unrefined forms of organic solids. Almost all raw "
"minerals can be processed in the <link=\"ROCKCRUSHER\">Rock Crusher</link>, "
"although a handful require the use of the "
"<link=\"SUPERMATERIALREFINERY\">Molecular Forge</link>."
