#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.SUBLIMATING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.SUBLIMATING_DESC"
msgid ""
"Sublimators are a class of <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> elements that passively convert to a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state. When off-gassing is complete, no trace of the original solid remains.\n"
"\n"
"This passive conversion persists when the element is left in storage."
msgstr ""

